    </p>
    <p>This includes, without limitation, damages for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Loss of profits, revenue, or business opportunities</li>
      <li>Data loss or corruption</li>
      <li>Code errors or system failures resulting from following our tutorials</li>
      <li>Financial decisions based on information published on the Site</li>
      <li>Any reliance on AI-generated code or technical advice</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM ARISING FROM THESE TERMS OR YOUR
